/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 91 0 R
/T (Problem Statement: Design and develop a high-efficiency schematic and PCB layout using KiCad within the given time frame \(4 Hours\) to serve as the central control system for a Line Follower Car)
/E (Problem Statement: Design and develop a high-efficiency schematic and PCB layout using KiCad within the given time frame \(4 Hours\) to serve as the central control system for a Line Follower Car)
