/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 91 0 R
/T (In addition to the PCB design, participants are encouraged to develop a complete CAD model of the system to enhance mechanical integration and usability. The CAD design should demonstrate thoughtful engineering by incorporating structural, accessibility, and thermal considerations.)
/E (In addition to the PCB design, participants are encouraged to develop a complete CAD model of the system to enhance mechanical integration and usability. The CAD design should demonstrate thoughtful engineering by incorporating structural, accessibility, and thermal considerations.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
